<h3 class="govuk-heading-s">How the decision is made and published</p>
<p class="govuk-body">The Inspector or appointed person uses the evidence collected to write a decision report.</p>
<p class="govuk-body">We publish the decision notice online. The notice includes:</p>
<ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
	<li>the reasons for the decision</li>
	<li>any conditions attached to the permission, if approved</li>
</ul>
